# ============================================================================
# Shared .gitignore
# Standard .NET build output + tooling artifacts, matching the pattern used
# across the other PlantSafety-family repos (Azure, PlantSafety, Reporting,
# etc.). Golden-file snapshots under __snapshots__/ are intentionally NOT
# ignored (Shared.SnapshotTesting) -- they are committed, reviewed
# baselines, not build output.
# ============================================================================

# Build output
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
[Oo]ut/
[Ll]og/
[Ll]ogs/

# Visual Studio
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates

# Rider / IntelliJ
.idea/
*.sln.iml

# VS Code
.vscode/

# NuGet
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
**/packages/*
!**/packages/build/
project.lock.json
project.fragment.lock.json
artifacts/

# Test results
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
*.trx
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

# MSBuild / dotnet
*.binlog
*.dotCover

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Rider/VS temp
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~

# Secrets / private key material - never commit, store in a secret vault instead.
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
!**/*.publickey
*.env
.env.*
